                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[i]Datswer[/i] plays like an amateur [i]Prince of Persia[/i] fangame that should never have left Newgrounds.  Glitches out the wazoo, a clumsy non-rebindable control scheme, and inconsistent platforming mechanics make this one to avoid.  The sheer incompetence and snippets of mangled English do offer some unintentional hilarity, but even so, I cannot in good conscience recommend this game.\n\nWell okay, maybe if you run a YouTube channel and need a bad game to entertain your subscribers, but to the average consumer, stay away!",
